---
import { affiliateLinks } from "../../../data/affiliateLinks";
---

<section class="bg-gradient-to-br from-indigo-700 via-blue-700 to-cyan-600 py-24 text-white">

<div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6">

<div class="grid items-center gap-14 lg:grid-cols-2">

<div>

<span class="rounded-full bg-white/20 px-5 py-2 text-sm font-bold">

⭐ 4.7 / 5 • CreatorStack Review

</span>

<h1 class="mt-8 text-6xl font-extrabold leading-tight">

PlayHT Review (2026)

</h1>

<p class="mt-8 text-xl leading-9 text-blue-100">

PlayHT is one of the leading AI voice generation platforms, offering realistic text-to-speech, multilingual voices, voice cloning, and a powerful API. But how does it compare to ElevenLabs? Here's our complete hands-on review.

</p>

<div class="mt-12 flex flex-wrap gap-5">

<a
href={affiliateLinks.playht}
target="_blank"
rel="nofollow sponsored noopener"
class="rounded-2xl bg-white px-8 py-4 font-bold text-blue-700 transition hover:scale-105"
>

🚀 Try PlayHT

</a>

<a
href="#pricing"
class="rounded-2xl border border-white/40 px-8 py-4 font-bold transition hover:bg-white/10"
>

View Pricing

</a>

</div>

</div>

<div class="flex justify-center">

<img
src="/images/tools/playht.png"
alt="PlayHT Review"
class="w-72 rounded-3xl shadow-2xl"
/>

</div>

</div>

</div>

</section>